      "step": "wire via tech.scaffold",
      "axis": "technology",
      "scaffold_summary": "Wiring boilerplate to bind ONE behavior's neutral machine to a React component tree and feed it a theme via CSS custom properties. Colors come from the THEME primitive (fetch_theme) and structure/parts from the BEHAVIOR primitive (fetch_behavior_primitive); this scaffold only connects them — it owns no color and no structure."
